OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet start to the day with
OL,6,Fsome heavy rain, soon brightening up
OL,7,Fto sunshine and scattered showers over
OL,8,FOrkney, then Shetland brightening in
OL,9,Fafternoon. Strong southeasterly winds
OL,10,Fat first over Shetland, veering
OL,11,Fwesterly and easing somewhat as it
OL,12,Fbrightens.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FThere will be a mixture of
OL,15,Fclear intervals and occasional
OL,16,Fshowers, some heavy especially across
OL,17,FOrkney. A moderate to fresh westerly
OL,18,Fbreeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
