OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FAnother day of bright or
OL,6,Fsunny intervals and occasional
OL,7,Fshowers, some on the heavy side.
OL,8,FLighter winds for Shetland, a fresh
OL,9,Fwest to northwesterly over Orkney.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunny
OL,12,Fintervals and isolated lighter showers
OL,13,Fon Sunday. Bright start Monday then
OL,14,Fcloudy with a little rain. Wet start
OL,15,FTuesday then sunshine and showers,
OL,16,Fgales.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
